// src/integration/mod.fu — Cross-Feature Integration Layer
//
// Connects all 16 advanced PLT subsystems so they cooperate in
// meaningful ways. Each pair of features is bridged by dedicated
// functions that enforce invariants across subsystem boundaries.
//
// Feature pairs:
//   Effect + Linear Types       Capability + Actor
//   Continuation + Coroutine    Effect + Concurrency
//   Linear + Capability         Dependent + Refinement
//   Macro + Effect              Reflection + Dispatch
//   TCO + Continuation          Safety + Provenance
//   Module + Capability         Observability + Effect
//   Gradual + Dependent         Actor + Concurrency
//   Staging + Effect

